---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Get the Free Field Guide — Finding the Right Words" description="A free 40-page Field Guide for acupoint tapping practitioners, by clinical psychologist David Feinstein, PhD.">
  <div class="rfg">

    <section class="intro">
      <div class="copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Free Field Guide for Tapping Practitioners</p>
        <h1>The Client Is Ready for the Next Tapping Phrase<span class="h1b">What Do You Say?</span></h1>
        <p>For optimal language in acupoint tapping psychotherapy, the Field Guide is a moment-by-moment compass for choosing the direction in which your next statement will move the session, accompanied by a map of the types of wording that will carry you there.</p>
        <p>In this free 40-page Guide, clinical psychologist David Feinstein, PhD, introduces a framework for recognizing what a client needs in the moment and choosing language that helps the therapeutic work unfold.</p>
        <p>Based on a decade of investigation and research published in <em>Frontiers in Psychology</em>, the Guide explores three directions for therapeutic language: Attune, Explore, and Lead.</p>
        <p>It&rsquo;s not a collection of scripts. It&rsquo;s a practical guide to reading the client, pacing the session, and finding words that fit.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cover-col" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="stack">
          <div class="sheet back b2"></div>
          <div class="sheet back b1"></div>
          <div class="sheet top">
            <div class="cover-name"><span>Practitioner</span><span>Compass</span></div>
            <div class="compass-art">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 260 260" role="img" aria-label="Practitioner compass">
                <defs>
                  <linearGradient id="wood" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0.9" y2="1">
                    <stop offset="0" stop-color="#8A5E36"/><stop offset=".45" stop-color="#5E3D22"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#331F10"/>
                  </linearGradient>
                  <linearGradient id="brass" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0.2" y2="1">
                    <stop offset="0" stop-color="#F3E1A8"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#B8903F"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#6E5122"/>
                  </linearGradient>
                  <linearGradient id="inlay" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                    <stop offset="0" stop-color="#D9B569"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#9C7231"/>
                  </linearGradient>
                  <radialGradient id="face" cx=".42" cy=".38" r=".74">
                    <stop offset="0" stop-color="#123049"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#091C2D"/>
                  </radialGradient>
                  <g id="card">
                    <path d="M130 6 L141 18 L130 30 L119 18 Z" fill="url(#inlay)" stroke="#2A1B0E" stroke-width="0.6" opacity=".95"/>
                    <path d="M130 11 L136 18 L130 25 L124 18 Z" fill="#5C3B22" opacity=".8"/>
                    <path d="M142 15 q12 -5 17 4 q3 6 -3 8 q-5 1 -5 -4" fill="url(#inlay)" opacity=".9"/>
                    <path d="M118 15 q-12 -5 -17 4 q-3 6 3 8 q5 1 5 -4" fill="url(#inlay)" opacity=".9"/>
                    <circle cx="163" cy="26" r="1.5" fill="url(#inlay)"/>
                    <circle cx="97" cy="26" r="1.5" fill="url(#inlay)"/>
                  </g>
                  <g id="dsm">
                    <path d="M130 9 L136 18 L130 27 L124 18 Z" fill="url(#inlay)" stroke="#2A1B0E" stroke-width="0.5" opacity=".9"/>
                  </g>
                </defs>
                <circle cx="130" cy="130" r="126" fill="url(#wood)"/>
                <circle cx="130" cy="130" r="120" fill="none" stroke="#2C1B0D" stroke-width="1" opacity=".2"/>
                <circle cx="130" cy="130" r="112" fill="none" stroke="#2C1B0D" stroke-width="1" opacity=".18"/>
                <circle cx="130" cy="130" r="126" fill="none" stroke="#231508" stroke-width="2"/>
                <use href="#card"/>
                <use href="#card" transform="rotate(90 130 130)"/>
                <use href="#card" transform="rotate(180 130 130)"/>
                <use href="#card" transform="rotate(270 130 130)"/>
                <use href="#dsm" transform="rotate(45 130 130)"/>
                <use href="#dsm" transform="rotate(135 130 130)"/>
                <use href="#dsm" transform="rotate(225 130 130)"/>
                <use href="#dsm" transform="rotate(315 130 130)"/>
                <circle cx="130" cy="130" r="97" fill="url(#face)"/>
                <circle cx="130" cy="130" r="97.3" fill="none" stroke="#231508" stroke-width="1.6" opacity=".65"/>
                <g fill="none" stroke-width="11" stroke-linecap="round">
                  <path d="M130 38.5 A91.5 91.5 0 0 1 209.2 175.8" stroke="#2E86B5"/>
                  <path d="M209.2 175.8 A91.5 91.5 0 0 1 50.8 175.8" stroke="#CB8642"/>
                  <path d="M50.8 175.8 A91.5 91.5 0 0 1 130 38.5" stroke="#4E9A6E"/>
                </g>
                <g stroke="#DCCBA2" stroke-width="1.2" opacity=".5">
                  <line x1="130" y1="130" x2="130" y2="38.5"/>
                  <line x1="130" y1="130" x2="209.2" y2="175.8"/>
                  <line x1="130" y1="130" x2="50.8" y2="175.8"/>
                </g>
                <g>
                  <path d="M130 65 L134.5 130 L125.5 130 Z" fill="#B5403A"/>
                  <path d="M130 195 L134.5 130 L125.5 130 Z" fill="#33383F"/>
                  <circle cx="130" cy="130" r="8" fill="url(#brass)" stroke="#6E521F" stroke-width="1"/>
                  <circle cx="130" cy="130" r="3" fill="#3A2414"/>
                </g>
                <text x="177" y="103" fill="#176C9B" font-family="Public Sans,sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1.5" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(60 177 103)">ATTUNE</text>
                <text x="130" y="184" fill="#9A6A22" font-family="Public Sans,sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1.5" text-anchor="middle">EXPLORE</text>
                <text x="83" y="103" fill="#3C7A55" font-family="Public Sans,sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1.5" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-60 83 103)">LEAD</text>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="cn-top"><span>The Needle Moves</span><span>with Moment-by-Moment Shifts</span><span>in the Session</span></div>
            <div class="cover-rule"></div>
            <h2 class="cover-title">Finding the Right Words</h2>
            <p class="cover-sub">Field Guide for Acupoint Tapping Practitioners</p>
            <p class="cover-author">David Feinstein, PhD</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="form-wrap" aria-label="Sign up for the Field Guide">
      <div class="form-card">
        <h2>Receive the Free Field Guide</h2>

        <!--
          ========================= ActiveCampaign integration =========================
          This form currently redirects to the thank-you page (which shows the Guide and
          download). It does NOT yet capture the email. To make capture + delivery live,
          Amber provides the AC form and we swap in:
            • the form `action` (AC proc.php URL) + method="post"
            • AC's field names (firstname / email / the marketing checkbox field or tag)
            • AC's post-submit redirect → /receive-field-guide/thank-you/
          Then delete the inline submit-redirect script below. The marketing checkbox must
          map to a tag so marketing emails go ONLY to people who tick it. No API key here.
          ============================================================================= -->
        <form id="rfg-form" novalidate>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="firstname">First name</label>
            <input type="text" id="firstname" name="firstname" autocomplete="given-name" placeholder="First name" required>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="email">Email address</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="Email address" required>
          </div>
          <label class="check">
            <input type="checkbox" name="marketing" value="yes">
            <span>I&rsquo;d also like a few short emails to help me put the Guide into practice, plus occasional clinical examples, research updates, and news from David Feinstein, PhD.</span>
          </label>
          <button type="submit">Send Me the Free Field Guide</button>
          <p class="fine">The Field Guide is free. Additional emails are optional, and you can unsubscribe at any time.</p>
        </form>
      </div>

      <figure class="endorse">
        <blockquote>&ldquo;. . . a valuable resource for both new and experienced tapping practitioners who want to move beyond simply applying a technique and develop greater precision, sensitivity, and skill in their clinical work.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <figcaption><b>Peta Stapleton, PhD</b> &middot; Professor of Psychology, Bond University, and author of <i>The Science Behind Tapping</i></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- Placeholder behavior until the ActiveCampaign form is connected: go to the
       thank-you page (which shows the Guide). No data is sent; email is never put in a URL. -->
  <script is:inline>
    (function(){
      var f=document.getElementById('rfg-form');
      if(!f) return;
      f.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        if(!f.checkValidity()){ f.reportValidity(); return; }
        window.location.href='/receive-field-guide/thank-you/';
      });
    })();
  </script>

  <style>
    .rfg{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.3rem}

    .intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:3rem;align-items:center;padding:3.2rem 0 2.4rem}
    .copy .eyebrow{font-family:var(--ui);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.74rem;color:var(--brass-deep);margin:0 0 1rem}
    .copy h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(2rem,4.2vw,2.8rem);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 1rem}
    .copy h1 .h1b{display:block;color:var(--brand)}
    .copy .deck{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:1.22rem;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 1.3rem}
    .copy p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:1.02rem;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 1rem}
    .copy p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}

    /* Stack-of-papers cover — same treatment as /fieldguide/ */
    .cover-col{display:flex;justify-content:center}
    .stack{position:relative;width:min(340px,80vw);margin:0 auto}
    .sheet{border-radius:4px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line)}
    .sheet.back{position:absolute;inset:0;box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(15,35,51,.08)}
    .sheet.b2{transform:rotate(2.6deg) translate(11px,13px);background:#FBF9F5}
    .sheet.b1{transform:rotate(-2.2deg) translate(-11px,7px)}
    .sheet.top{position:relative;z-index:3;padding:2rem 1.6rem 1.9rem;text-align:center;
      box-shadow:0 2px 0 #fff,0 4px 0 #efe9df,0 6px 0 #fff,0 8px 0 #ece6da,0 22px 50px rgba(15,35,51,.17)}
    .cover-name{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.02rem;align-items:center;margin:0 0 .6rem;
      font-family:var(--ui);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.7rem;color:var(--brass-deep)}
    .compass-art{width:100%;max-width:200px;margin:0 auto .3rem}
    .compass-art svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
    .cn-top{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.02rem;align-items:center;margin:.1rem 0 1rem;
      font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.86rem;line-height:1.35}
    .cover-rule{width:44px;height:1px;background:var(--line);margin:0 auto .9rem}
    .cover-title{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;color:var(--navy);font-size:1.7rem;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 .35rem}
    .cover-sub{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.96rem;margin:0 0 .9rem}
    .cover-author{font-family:var(--ui);font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);font-size:.88rem;margin:0}

    .form-wrap{max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 0 3.6rem}
    .form-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 12px 34px rgba(15,35,51,.07);padding:2.2rem 2rem}
    .form-card h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;color:var(--navy);font-size:1.65rem;margin:0 0 1.3rem;text-align:center}
    .field{margin:0 0 1rem}
    .field label{display:block;font-family:var(--ui);font-weight:600;font-size:.86rem;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 .35rem}
    .field input{width:100%;font-family:var(--ui);font-size:1rem;padding:.8rem .9rem;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}
    .field input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--brand)}
    .check{display:flex;gap:.6rem;align-items:flex-start;margin:.2rem 0 1.3rem;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.45}
    .check input{margin-top:.2rem;flex:0 0 auto;width:1.05rem;height:1.05rem;accent-color:var(--brand)}
    button[type=submit]{width:100%;font-family:var(--ui);font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:.95rem 1.4rem;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s}
    button[type=submit]:hover{background:#17304a}
    .fine{color:var(--ink-faint);font-size:.84rem;text-align:center;margin:1.1rem 0 0}

    .endorse{margin:1.8rem 0 0;text-align:center}
    .endorse blockquote{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;color:var(--navy);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.5;margin:0 auto;max-width:44ch}
    .endorse figcaption{color:var(--ink-faint);font-size:.88rem;margin:.8rem 0 0}
    .endorse figcaption b{color:var(--ink)}

    @media(max-width:820px){
      .intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem;padding:2.4rem 0 1.8rem;text-align:center}
      .copy h1{max-width:18ch;margin-inline:auto}
      .copy .deck,.copy p{max-width:52ch;margin-inline:auto}
      .cover-col{order:-1}
      .stack{width:min(300px,72vw)}
    }
    @media(max-width:560px){
      .form-card{padding:1.7rem 1.3rem}
      .check{text-align:left}
    }
  </style>
</Base>
